<title>INDIA: India EIH 96/97 6-mth net up 18.87 pct.</title>
<headline>India EIH 96/97 6-mth net up 18.87 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	  (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    474.3    vs	399.0</p>
<p>    Net sales	   1,951.2    vs    1,649.2</p>
<p>    Expenditure	 1,347.6    vs    1,146.1</p>
<p>    Gross Profit	  640.8    vs	544.0</p>
<p>    Interest		 65.6    vs	 81.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   56.5    vs	 55.0</p>
<p>    Tax		     110.0    vs	 90.0</p>
<p>Note: EIH Ltd was formerly East India Hotels Ltd. The firm said its paid-up capital increased to 349.29 million rupees after an issue of 11,25,114 equity shares on November 6. It said half-year results are not indicative of the full years' working in the hotel industry.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
